{"slug":"Steal-a-Brainrot-SAB-Local-49529","_id":"68a74cb38f824dfe93f5148b","title":"SAB Local","game":{"_id":"68313258440874f0e1fb73d9","gameId":109983668079237,"name":"Steal a Brainrot","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":109983668079237},"features":"Player Features\nQ Dash – Hold Q to dash forward with increased speed.\n\nCoil MS – Automatically adjusts movement speed; slows down if \"Stolen\" text is detected.\n\nAnti Fling – Prevents other players from flinging you by stabilizing your character.\n\nJump Boost – Enhances your jump height significantly.\n\nPlatforms – Spawn platforms by pressing E; remove them with C.\n\nShark Glide – Ride a shark model that allows gliding and controlled descent.\n\nPermanent Invisibility – Hides your character using the Invisibility Cloak.\n\nLock (Anchor) – Locks your character in place, preventing movement or knockback.\n\nESP Features\nBase ESP – Highlights players who enter your base area.\n\nInvis ESP – Reveals invisible players by detecting their movement speed.\n\nMost Valuable ESP – Tracks the highest-value animal in the game with a tracer.\n\nClone ESP – Identifies and tags clone characters in the workspace.\n\nTime ESP – Shows plot ownership timers with enhanced visibility.\n\nUtility Features\nLoad Dex – Executes the Dex Explorer tool for advanced Roblox exploration.\n\nShop Mover – Moves the shop NPC closer to you for easier access.\n\nSteal Block – Automatically shuts down the game if someone enters your steal zone.\n\nFast Proximity – Makes all proximity prompts instant (no hold required).\n\nSkip Tutorial – Skips the tutorial phase automatically.\n\nKill Turret – Automatically attacks sentry turrets with the Tung Bat.\n\nSpectator Mode – Allows freecam movement while ragdolling your character.\n\nFriend Toggle – Toggles friend-only plot access via remote call.\n\nBee Bypass – Prevents anti-cheat modifications to your camera and controls.\n\nNight Mode – Forces the game to nighttime permanently.\n\nSlap Aura – Automatically equips and uses the Tung Bat repeatedly.\n\nMWR (Move While Ragdoll) – Allows movement even when ragdolled.\n\nFinder Features\nSecret Finder – Highlights secret animals and their locations.\n\nGod Finder – Locates Brainrot God-tier animals in the game.\n\nTroll Features\nEar Grape (Auto Equip) – Hurts peoples ears.\n\nServer Features\nNPS Bug – Teleports you to a New Player Server (NPS).\n\nRejoin – Rejoins the same server instance.\n\nJoin via JID – Enter a Job ID to join a specific server.\n\nFor more info go to https://sablocal.xyz","tags":["steal a brainrot","steal a brainrot mod menu","mod menu","SAB","Pet finder"],"script":"-- This is just the loader for the script that takes you to the Discord server. The script and key system are in the Discord server.\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prototbh/SAB_Local/refs/heads/main/script.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"689b7b207a31c09ead8a8330","username":"prototbhh","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ce7a95131054b9bf6476b7325b2b516f55fa8196140290bfa79254f7182edc77.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/689b7b207a31c09ead8a8330-1755020123785.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"689b7b207a31c09ead8a8330","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ce7a95131054b9bf6476b7325b2b516f55fa8196140290bfa79254f7182edc77.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/689b7b207a31c09ead8a8330-1755020123785.jpg"}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/W6J2Qqc4M8","keyLink":"https://discord.gg/8t895CxPx8","views":45392,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/361b9e1f19911882f30f4740bea9daff61ea2461c106c4db94d042fe53d222ef.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-e4f5ae4a5d3f7bf188